WEBVTT

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.600
Kikou wa nori no warui

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:16.340
Watashi ga sanka suru

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:22.380
Hisabisa no doraibu de minna hai tenshon

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:25.250
Kare mo kuru no

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.850
Myaku ga ima wa nakutomo

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:32.590
Zettai ikimasu tomo

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:38.630
Sugoi sugoi pookaa faisu dato shitara

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.770
Aru yo nante

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:48.810
Umi wa hiyake suru kara, yama ni shiyou tte

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:58.390
Koo-to no kisetsu nanoni kanchigai shiteru

00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:02.620
Doushite nano?

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:06.590
Konna ureshikute

00:01:06.590 --> 00:01:14.400
Chigiresouna hodo waratte iru noni

00:01:14.770 --> 00:01:22.940
Kare no senaka mite wa mune tsumaru

00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:30.910
Taenai egao no utsu no naka de

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:47.470
Lise...Lise...

00:01:47.470 --> 00:01:49.800
Hey, someone! We still need to keep her asleep.

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:51.170
We'll begin once the preparations for
a blood transfusion are done.

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:51.570
Lise...
We'll begin once the preparations for
a blood transfusion are done.

00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:52.170
Lise...
Yes!

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:54.140
Lise...Lise...

00:01:55.980 --> 00:01:57.600
Lise...

00:01:58.910 --> 00:02:03.040
Episode #20
The Room That's Left Behind

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:07.960
Judging from the symptoms,
I'd say it's just a cold.

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.020
Is that so?

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:12.660
However, my concern is that the fever
would usually go higher,

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:15.430
but with her case, it's particularly low.

00:02:15.430 --> 00:02:17.730
Her body temperature is too low.

00:02:17.730 --> 00:02:22.860
Well, she should go to a bigger
hospital and have a workup.

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:29.810
Rose!

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:30.580
Dad!

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:30.810
You still need to rest.
Dad!

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:31.980
You still need to rest.

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:38.020
No, I think I've slept enough.
I feel perfectly fine.

00:02:38.020 --> 00:02:39.550
Are you sure?

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:42.590
Oh yeah, do you have lemons?

00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:43.890
Sure...

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:50.300
Paul and Carrie did a good job with
the Christmas decorations.

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:51.930
I see.

00:02:52.470 --> 00:02:54.200
I'm sorry about today.

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:56.540
I wanted to help you, but I ended up
causing extra trouble instead.

00:02:56.540 --> 00:03:01.510
That's all right, but are you sure you're okay?

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:03.280
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:04.580
Okay.

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:08.250
Paul and Carrie did that?

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:11.820
Yeah, Mom has been doing well lately.

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:14.560
It looks like she can come home
temporarily for Christmas.

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:17.460
Those two have been so excited about it, so...

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:19.430
That's great.

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:24.230
Yeah, those two have been waiting for
you to come home too.

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:25.860
I see...

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:29.800
Guess I'm going home now.

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:32.310
Okay, goodnight.

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:33.930
Goodnight.

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:54.360
How's school? You've been
going to school right?

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:56.460
Yeah, more or less.

00:03:56.460 --> 00:04:00.030
I see. How are your living conditions?

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:01.470
You've been eating like you're supposed to?

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:03.810
I'm fine. I've got a part-time job too.

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:07.340
Does it get cold in your room? They said
it's going to be a cold winter this year.

00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:08.580
It's fine!

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:10.180
I see.

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:11.250
You know...

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:13.280
I came to see you about Randy today.

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:16.550
Yeah, it sounds like he's doing
better than I thought.

00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:20.360
Look, Randy isn't cut out to run a business.

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:20.960
What?

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:21.360
You need to stop giving him hopes
by telling him random stuff!
What?

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:24.260
You need to stop giving him hopes
by telling him random stuff!

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:25.560
Why would you think that?

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:26.290
What?

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:26.560
I think Randy is talented.
What?

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:29.550
I think Randy is talented.

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:32.630
You've been ignoring him all this time,

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:34.240
but now you're going to manipulate
him by smooth-talking him?!

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:36.700
Seriously, I thought that was a good idea at first.

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:38.370
Yeah, whatever!

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:40.710
I'm telling you the truth.
It was all good at the beginning.

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:45.650
But the trouble started brewing when
the funds started coming in.

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:46.610
What?

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:51.190
All the ateliers that Randy was dealing with
at the beginning were high-quality,

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:56.290
but as more people got involved the
quality went down the hill.

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:57.930
You sure know a lot, don't you?

00:04:57.930 --> 00:05:01.530
In order to find out exactly where in
the process he got cheated

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:04.000
and how far he needs to trace back
to rebuild the business

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:07.000
I was traveling all over Europe,
following the trail of Randy.

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:07.870
What?

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:10.640
I found people who cheated him and retrieved
the money that they stole from him.

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:12.440
I did all kinds of stuff.

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:16.310
I made the rounds checking into every single
atelier and gallery that was involved too.

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:17.610
What do you mean?

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:19.810
And this is the information that I collected.

00:05:19.810 --> 00:05:25.190
I did everything I could, but a lot of the
things were already too late to fix.

00:05:25.190 --> 00:05:29.290
And in the end, Randy had to
suffer such a consequence.

00:05:29.290 --> 00:05:30.290
Dad...

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:32.660
Claire, just like you told me at the hospital,

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:37.770
I don't blame you for comparing this incident
with what happened to you mother.

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:40.500
Fortunately, Randy was saved.

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:45.410
I just want to help him in any way I can, so
he'll never have to be in that position again.

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:46.740
He's still in that kind of condition,

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:49.040
but he should be able to study
something at least.

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:53.820
I want to get his business off the ground,

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:56.450
but he himself is the one who has to work at it.

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:59.850
Maybe I was a little too easy on him.

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:05.290
So, I want him to start from the basics
and get back on his feet on his own.

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:08.030
And I have faith that he can do it.

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:09.630
Why would you say that much?

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:16.500
Because he's my family. Randy is my
family, and you are, too, Claire.

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:23.810
When your mother passed away I gave myself
over to work without even facing you two.

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:28.150
When you two needed me the most, I turned my
back on you and escaped into work,

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:34.490
even though it must have been much
harder on you kids than it was on me.

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:40.060
I couldn't see anything. I was just prostrated
with the sorrow of losing your mother.

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:42.400
How horrible...

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:45.730
You might say it's too late,
but I feel that I can do something

00:06:45.730 --> 00:06:50.510
so that you two can live your
lives in good spirits.

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:54.840
And I believe that's what your
mother wants too.

00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:56.470
Dad...

00:06:58.180 --> 00:06:59.650
Are you driving?

00:06:59.650 --> 00:07:00.520
Yeah...

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.050
Be careful.

00:07:02.050 --> 00:07:03.790
Okay.

00:07:03.790 --> 00:07:07.860
Claire, I want you to feel free to
stop by anytime you want.

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:09.860
I know it's an extravagant
looking building and all.

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:11.790
It doesn't bother me.

00:07:11.790 --> 00:07:14.000
What do you say we go out for dinner sometime?

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:16.460
There's a good Indian restaurant nearby.

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:21.740
Hmm, Indian food, huh? I'd rather go have
Italian food or something like that.

00:07:21.740 --> 00:07:27.440
Sure! If that's the case, how about the one
called II Col...What was that name?

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:28.340
It's a good place?

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:32.950
Yeah! Oh, but you still can't drink wine, huh?

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:34.350
Let's see what else...

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:35.980
I'll call you.

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:38.090
Do that, you can call me anytime.

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:41.460
Okay, then bye.

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:42.590
Claire!

00:07:42.590 --> 00:07:44.830
Hmm?

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:46.930
No, it's all right. I've got one.

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:48.560
But it's cold today.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:51.670
It smells like cigarette smoke.

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:54.600
Really? You know I've stopped smoking.

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:56.330
Just kidding.

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:58.770
See you later.

00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:00.430
Yeah...

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:12.850
People would get the wrong idea if they
saw me wearing a man's scarf like this.

00:08:14.020 --> 00:08:16.390
He just doesn't get it, does he?

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:19.190
So stupid...

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:23.390
Jeez, so annoying...

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:37.250
Hello?

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:38.280
No way!

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:39.580
She's been captured?!

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:41.520
I'm trying to confirm that right now.

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:43.350
You need to assemble as soon as possible!

00:08:43.350 --> 00:08:45.520
This is different from the previous case!
It's this one!

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:46.990
Individual difference is very slight.

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:48.060
Don't worry about it too much.

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:50.690
We just have to change the procedures.
We'll begin as soon as we're ready!

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:52.320
Yes, sir.

00:08:57.160 --> 00:08:58.470
That window on the third floor.

00:08:58.470 --> 00:08:59.330
Got it.

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:00.960
Let's go.

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:11.210
Hey!

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:12.650
Isn't that Herve?

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:14.220
He betrayed us the other day, right?

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:15.840
What?

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:19.290
Where is he?

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:20.990
He's in the emergency staircase
on the south side.

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:23.020
Go down! We'll be heading that way too!

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:25.260
We heard you! We're heading to the emergency
staircase on the south side too!

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:25.990
Hurry! This way!

00:09:25.990 --> 00:09:27.620
I said on the south side!
Hurry! This way!

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:29.500
So, she is...

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:30.530
Yes.

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:33.070
She's young. Can we do this?

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:35.500
We've already figured out why
we failed with Lise.

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:36.800
We don't have much time.

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:37.470
Right...

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:37.810
Mr. Raul...
Right...

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:39.370
Mr. Raul...

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:42.040
It looks like Herve has managed
to enter the building.

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:43.040
Go ahead and start.

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:43.640
Yes, sir.

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:44.050
Anna is what Herve is after. Bring her here.
Yes, sir.

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:46.550
Anna is what Herve is after. Bring her here.

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:48.170
Yes.

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:58.560
What? Isn't it on the north side? North?

00:09:58.560 --> 00:10:01.000
This is supposed to be an ordinary
pharmaceutical company right?

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:02.760
Are you sure Kate is in a place like this?

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:05.470
I'm sure of it. J.C. Was on their
trail for a long time.

00:10:05.470 --> 00:10:09.100
But this is huge. How are we going to find her?

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:13.370
Below us is a normal pharmaceutical
company. We'll keep on going up,

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:15.000
to the top floor.

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:23.280
This is the top floor. Huh? What did you say?

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:36.860
Lise!

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:37.130
The anesthesia isn't working on her!
Lise!

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:38.170
The anesthesia isn't working on her!

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:38.470
Let me go! Lise!

00:10:38.470 --> 00:10:40.200
What are you doing? Hurry up and strap her.
Let me go! Lise!

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:41.470
What are you doing? Hurry up and strap her.

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:42.440
What's the number on the monitor?

00:10:42.440 --> 00:10:43.340
It's normal.

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:44.310
Good.

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:45.070
We'll begin.

00:10:45.070 --> 00:10:45.310
Stop it! What are you going to do?
We'll begin.

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:47.340
Stop it! What are you going to do?

00:10:47.340 --> 00:10:48.970
Hold her!

00:10:49.340 --> 00:10:50.410
What's going on?

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:52.040
We don't know!

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:01.980
Let's hurry.

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:08.120
Emilio?! You...

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:13.670
Emilio...

00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:14.800
Let's get out of here, Kate.

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:15.640
What are you doing here?

00:11:15.640 --> 00:11:17.240
I'll explain that to you later. Come on!

00:11:17.240 --> 00:11:18.870
Wait!

00:11:20.680 --> 00:11:24.910
Lise! Lise! Come with us! Lise!

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:28.540
Who are you?

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:48.160
Anna...Anna...

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:55.780
Where is Anna?

00:11:55.780 --> 00:11:57.400
Say it!

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:02.280
Come on, hurry up!

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:04.120
Lise, hang in there.

00:12:04.120 --> 00:12:06.220
Where are we going?

00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:09.390
Damn! Kate, we need to hurry!
It's too late for Lise!

00:12:09.390 --> 00:12:10.730
Let me go!

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:13.390
You're the man who's been deceiving Emma!

00:12:13.390 --> 00:12:14.360
Kate...

00:12:14.360 --> 00:12:16.500
She's still crying over you!

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:21.070
I'm very sorry, but I was truly in love with Emma!

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:21.900
Who would believe such a thing?!

00:12:21.900 --> 00:12:22.700
Believe me! Things have turned out this way,
Who would believe such a thing?!

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:24.940
Believe me! Things have turned out this way,

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:25.770
but I was serious about her.

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:26.140
That's a lie!

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:26.910
I heard someone's voice over there!
That's a lie!

00:12:26.910 --> 00:12:27.840
I heard someone's voice over there!

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:29.740
Damn!

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:32.910
Kate, hurry up!

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:34.540
Lise, let's go!

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:37.320
What are you doing?

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:39.810
Don't worry about it. Come on, let's go!

00:12:46.690 --> 00:12:48.490
Hey, you!

00:12:56.570 --> 00:13:00.800
I'll take care of it here, so you take
Lise and get out of here!

00:13:11.090 --> 00:13:11.920
Lise!

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:13.750
Kate, it's too late!

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:15.090
Let me go, Emilio!

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:17.160
Kate, Lise isn't the same Lise
that you knew anymore!

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:18.330
Someone's still in there! Hurry up!
Kate, Lise isn't the same Lise
that you knew anymore!

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:19.190
Someone's still in there! Hurry up!

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:22.460
Listen, Kate. I want to save you!

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:24.230
You're Emma's sister!

00:13:24.230 --> 00:13:26.700
My precious Emma's sister!

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:27.840
I was serious about her.

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:30.370
I loved her more than anyone else!

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:33.510
I'm sorry this had to happen.

00:13:33.510 --> 00:13:36.140
Emilio, Emma is...

00:13:37.410 --> 00:13:39.040
Emilio?

00:13:48.490 --> 00:13:50.120
Emilio...

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:53.650
Emilio!

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:58.600
They're coming. You need to get out of here.

00:13:58.600 --> 00:13:59.770
But...

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:01.390
I don't care, just go!

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:04.230
Emilio!

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:09.740
Emma...Emma, I'm sorry...

00:14:09.940 --> 00:14:11.780
Emilio...

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:16.680
Run, Kate. Go to Emma alive.

00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:19.490
Over here! There's an Animus!

00:14:19.490 --> 00:14:21.280
Go, Kate!

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:40.470
Nothing frustrates me more than getting
interrupted in the middle of my operation!

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:46.380
This is the end of it. It was your mistake
to have kept me alive!

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:49.810
Kate!

00:14:50.380 --> 00:14:52.150
Kate, you're safe!

00:14:52.820 --> 00:14:54.790
Please, help me!

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:56.290
Lise is...Lise is...

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:57.830
Lise? What about her?

00:14:57.830 --> 00:14:59.130
They took Lise and...

00:14:59.130 --> 00:15:00.960
What? You mean Lise is alive?!

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:01.930
Was she moving?

00:15:01.930 --> 00:15:03.430
Please, save Lise!

00:15:03.430 --> 00:15:05.770
Stop it! We must get out of here quickly.

00:15:05.770 --> 00:15:07.030
Hey, wait a second!

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:09.140
I'm telling you the truth, Lise is...

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:11.670
Damn it, I'm going!

00:15:11.670 --> 00:15:12.340
Hold it right there!

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:12.810
I'm coming too!
Hold it right there!

00:15:12.810 --> 00:15:13.930
I'm coming too!

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:16.640
I am too!

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:19.750
How dare you?! You killed Emilio too!

00:15:19.750 --> 00:15:21.740
That's as far as you can go, Herve.

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:25.340
Anna!

00:15:26.350 --> 00:15:29.250
Please stop it, Big Brother.

00:15:29.920 --> 00:15:34.530
Raul, get your hands off of her.
What do you think you're doing now?

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:39.000
Herve, you're about to destroy
the future for all of us.

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:40.430
That's what YOU'RE doing!

00:15:40.430 --> 00:15:42.570
Going crazy over ridiculous experiments,

00:15:42.570 --> 00:15:44.740
without even trying to face Anna!

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:47.110
I'm thinking about the future of the entire family.

00:15:47.110 --> 00:15:49.840
You're just letting your emotions
make you go wild!

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:52.910
You can't even save Anna or Mireille,
but you're talking about the family's future?!

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:57.020
Because of you we're facing the greatest crisis!

00:15:57.020 --> 00:15:59.790
What about that crisis that
you've been lying about

00:15:59.790 --> 00:16:01.220
and procrastinating about and concealing?

00:16:01.220 --> 00:16:03.460
I wonder which sin is greater?!

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:06.860
You're the one who's been
deceiving the entire family!

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:09.960
You don't have a right to talk to
me that way anymore, Herve.

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:11.170
What did you say?!

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:13.070
You have been removed from the family.

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:14.740
You are not our family nor our friend.

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:16.440
You're just a rotten backstabber!

00:16:16.440 --> 00:16:18.210
What?!

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:20.440
Take care of this man.

00:16:20.440 --> 00:16:21.580
Big Brother...

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:25.100
Keep her in the private room.
She's not going to make it.

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:31.450
Wait.

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:32.820
I said wait.

00:16:32.820 --> 00:16:39.390
What is it, Herve?

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:42.590
Herve, how dare you?

00:17:00.710 --> 00:17:02.120
How awful...

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:03.740
Lise!

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:09.050
Lise! Where are you going, Lise? Wait!

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:28.870
Lise...

00:17:33.410 --> 00:17:35.040
Lise!

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:44.590
You saw that, didn't you?
Animus' bodies are good for nothing.

00:17:44.590 --> 00:17:47.460
All the experiments have been failing!

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:50.160
He's been making you envision
impossible dreams!

00:17:50.160 --> 00:17:51.570
There's no way for us to survive other than

00:17:51.570 --> 00:17:56.670
retrieving the other book of curses
that the Animus possess!

00:17:56.670 --> 00:17:58.640
Let's go. Hurry!

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:07.250
The book of curses can be found at the
school located on Roosevelt Island.

00:18:07.250 --> 00:18:08.650
There's no turning back.

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:11.880
We must steal it with our hands
and remove this curse!

00:18:23.030 --> 00:18:25.570
I see...The Dolore did...

00:18:25.570 --> 00:18:27.130
It must have been terrible.

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:32.570
No, we're okay, but I'm sure they'll come
here and start attacking soon.

00:18:32.570 --> 00:18:34.410
Why would they attack the school?

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:36.180
Is there something here?

00:18:36.180 --> 00:18:41.840
Well, I suppose we'll let you meet
our representative today.

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:48.020
All of us here are living assumed lives.

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:51.430
Only women can receive assumed lives.

00:18:51.430 --> 00:18:53.760
If someone gives up on living along the way,
we recruit someone else,

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:57.060
always maintaining the same total number
as the number of coffins here.

00:18:57.060 --> 00:18:59.900
You guys are the newest Animus.

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:01.970
So, you are too, Miss Lucy?

00:19:01.970 --> 00:19:03.600
Yes...

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:10.510
I'm much, much older than the
President of the Board of Directors.

00:19:10.510 --> 00:19:11.980
Isn't that a little odd?

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:14.810
I guess it's not that funny, huh?

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:19.210
And there's another special room below here.

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:22.720
It's our masters' room.

00:19:29.030 --> 00:19:30.660
Anna...

00:19:43.610 --> 00:19:45.650
Hi, Mary.

00:19:45.650 --> 00:19:48.080
Where's the book of curses?

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:49.820
Where's the Dolore's book?

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:52.590
Just a little longer, just one more.

00:19:52.590 --> 00:19:56.190
There's only one woman left in the Dolore.

00:19:56.190 --> 00:20:02.830
Really? That's the truth, right? I can't wait to die.

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:05.030
I can't wait to die.

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:06.430
I don't want to do this anymore.

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:08.570
I don't care if I can't go outside.

00:20:08.570 --> 00:20:11.170
I just want to get my freedom back and die.

00:20:11.170 --> 00:20:13.370
She wants to die?

00:20:14.170 --> 00:20:16.640
What are these kids?

00:20:16.640 --> 00:20:21.580
There are our masters. They've been
living for hundreds of years.

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:22.420
What?

00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:25.890
Long, long ago, during the conflict
between the Animus and the Dolore,

00:20:25.890 --> 00:20:29.460
one of the books of curses got
stolen by the Dolore.

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:33.790
And because of that, the Dolore were put
under a curse that they manifest and die.

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:39.320
And these girls, the Animus, lost their freedom
and were cursed with continuing life.

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:44.640
In order to remove the curse, we must retrieve
the other book of curses from the Dolore,

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:46.570
and reunite the two books.

00:20:47.170 --> 00:20:53.080
We are fighting for these girls
who're unable to move.

00:20:53.080 --> 00:20:57.720
They've given us, who died, assumed
lives to accomplish that.

00:20:57.720 --> 00:21:03.190
If we win the battle, we'll lose our memories
but continue to live, right?

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:06.160
But you want to die?

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:09.930
That's right, I don't want an eternal life anymore.

00:21:09.930 --> 00:21:12.430
We just want to end it.

00:21:12.430 --> 00:21:19.270
If you guys lose, we'll continue to live here
without being able to do anything.

00:21:19.270 --> 00:21:24.140
So please, be sure to retrieve
the book of curses for us.

00:21:28.950 --> 00:21:31.390
My only love sprung from my only hate

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:33.790
Too early seen unknown, and known too late

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:38.720
Prodigious birth of love it is to me,
that I must love a loathed enemy

00:21:39.130 --> 00:21:41.560
Step by step kimi to deatte

00:21:41.560 --> 00:21:44.130
Toki wo wasurete odoriakashita

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:46.430
Hoshi ni yadoru sadame wo shirazu ni

00:21:46.430 --> 00:21:48.970
I can't stop falling in love

00:21:48.970 --> 00:21:51.540
Fujitsu na tsuki no kaketa moraru ni

00:21:51.540 --> 00:21:53.870
Terasareru no wa michita desire

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:56.240
Sadame wo daita boku wa sakenda

00:21:56.240 --> 00:21:58.810
"Wherefore art thou Juliet?"

00:21:58.810 --> 00:22:00.610
Oroka na koi dato

00:22:01.110 --> 00:22:02.950
Azawarau ga iisa

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:05.520
Subete nagedashite

00:22:06.020 --> 00:22:07.950
Ima sugu ni yuku kara

00:22:08.620 --> 00:22:10.990
Oh, my Juliet...

00:22:11.060 --> 00:22:15.430
Ne kamisama oshiete yo

00:22:15.430 --> 00:22:20.660
Dou sureba negai wa kanau

00:22:21.030 --> 00:22:25.310
Ah! Konnani setsunakute

00:22:25.310 --> 00:22:28.210
Yozora ni naku yo

00:22:29.640 --> 00:22:36.350
Ne dare mo ga konna omoi wo daite

00:22:36.350 --> 00:22:39.590
Nemuri ni tsuku no

00:22:39.590 --> 00:22:43.890
Ah! Ima sugu me wo samashite

00:22:43.890 --> 00:22:46.730
Uso dato waratte yo

00:22:46.730 --> 00:22:49.160
Oh, my sweet Juliet

00:22:50.800 --> 00:22:53.270
Nemureru kimi to na mo naki boku wa

00:22:53.270 --> 00:22:54.770
Higeki no ame ni utare

00:22:54.770 --> 00:22:56.430
Say good die

00:23:02.540 --> 00:23:06.070
Eternal parting and unstoppable tears...

00:23:07.210 --> 00:23:09.720
The girls no longer hesitate.

00:23:09.720 --> 00:23:12.090
Episode #21
The Last Morning
The girls no longer hesitate.

00:23:12.090 --> 00:23:14.520
Episode #21
The Last Morning
